        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "0fbc9a6c-f377-5413-a2e1-f3ec815b0adc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jaume Collet-Serra, Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Michelle Dockery, Lupita Nyong'o, Scoot McNairy, Andrew Rona\n- Films: Non-Stop, Project X, Equilibrium, Scream, Scary Movie\n- Television Series: Downton Abbey\n- Awards: Emmy Awards, Golden Globe Awards\n\nFacts:\n- From 2010 to 2015, Michelle Dockery was widely known for playing Lady Mary Crawley in the television period drama series Downton Abbey on ITV in the UK and PBS in the U.S.\n- For Downton Abbey, Michelle Dockery received three consecutive Emmy Award nominations for Outstanding Lead Actress in a Drama Series and one Golden Globe Award nomination.\n- In 2014, Non-Stop was released as an American mystery action thriller film directed by Jaume Collet-Serra.\n- Non-Stop starred Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Michelle Dockery, Lupita Nyong'o, and Scoot McNairy.\n- Andrew Rona has produced over 100 films, including Non-Stop, Project X, Equilibrium, Scream, and Scary Movie.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
